flowchart TD
  subgraph Define
    D1["Coordinator: run Start and readiness checks"] -->|Coordinator: assess readiness| D2{"Coordinator: approved and ready?"}
    D2 -->|Coordinator: ready; bypass interview| D5["Coordinator: confirm readiness and Project status"]
    D2 -->|Coordinator: identify gaps and brief Planner| D3["Planner: interview Maintainer and record requirements"]
    D3 -->|Planner: submit requirements| D4{"Maintainer: accept requirements?"}
    D4 -->|Maintainer: request changes| D3
    D4 -->|Maintainer: accept| D5
  end
  D5 -->|Coordinator: close Define and brief Planner| P1
  subgraph Plan
    P1["Planner: write implementation plan"] -->|Coordinator: request assessment| P2["Architect: assess plan"]
    P2 -->|Architect: report recommendations| P3{"Planner: any out-of-scope recommendations?"}
    P3 -->|Planner: revise in-scope recommendations| P5["Coordinator: confirm obligations and close Plan"]
    P3 -->|Coordinator: refer scope decisions| P4["Maintainer: decide; Planner: revise authorized plan"]
    P4 -->|Planner: report decisions and revised plan| P5
  end
  P5 -->|Coordinator: authorize handoff| I1
  subgraph Implement
    I1["Coordinator: check cycle authorization and brief Coder; Maintainer: extend cycle six or later"] -->|Coordinator: assign authorized work| I2["Coder: implement and validate; Maintainer: approve outline when needed"]
    I2 -->|Coder: hand back revision and evidence| I3{"Coordinator: eligible explicit waiver for exact revision?"}
    I3 -->|Coordinator: no eligible waiver; dispatch Reviewer| I3a["Reviewer: independently review whole issue revision"]
    I3a -->|Reviewer: report recommendation| I4{"Reviewer: any findings?"}
    I3 -->|Maintainer: explicit waiver; Coordinator: record and count cycle| I5
    I4 -->|Maintainer: authorize fixes after findings| I1
    I4 -->|Reviewer: accept; Coordinator: hand back| I5{"Maintainer: review and give final sign-off?"}
    I5 -->|Maintainer: request changes| I1
    I5 -->|Maintainer: sign off; Coordinator: dispatch Architect| I6["Architect: assess signed-off commit"]
    I6 -->|Coordinator: present recommendations| I7{"Maintainer: authorize changes?"}
    I7 -->|Maintainer: authorize changes| I1
    I7 -->|Maintainer: authorize no further changes| I8["Coordinator: verify matching review or waiver, sign-off, assessment and validation"]
  end
  A["Maintainer: confirm direct assignment while Coordinator unavailable; Coder: record same briefing and gates"] -.->|Coder: retain and relay assignment evidence| I1
  W["Maintainer: waive only isolated one- or two-line logical delta; Coordinator: reject splitting and carryover"] -.->|Coordinator: re-evaluate each revision; Coder: retain validation| I3
  I8 -->|Coordinator: close Implement and hand back| U1
  subgraph Publish
    U1["Maintainer: push signed-off revision"] -->|Maintainer: confirm push| U1a["Coordinator: open or reuse PR"]
    U1a -->|GitHub: run CI| U2{"GitHub: CI passes?"}
    U2 -->|GitHub: report failure| U3["Coordinator: diagnose failure or merge blocker"]
    U3 -->|Coordinator: retry transient failure on same commit| U2
    U3 -->|Maintainer: authorize file change; Coordinator: retain cycle count| I1
    U2 -->|GitHub: report passing CI| U4{"Coordinator: no pending PR feedback and signed-off revision matches?"}
    U4 -->|Coordinator: report blocker| U5["Maintainer: give direction; Coordinator: hold merge"]
    U5 -->|Maintainer: direct file-change diagnosis| U3
    U5 -->|Maintainer: give direction; Coordinator: recheck| U4
    U4 -->|Coordinator: confirm gates; Maintainer: merge| U6["GitHub: delete remote branch after merge"]
    U6 -->|GitHub: record branch deletion| U7["Maintainer: confirm merge; Coordinator: close Publish"]
  end
  U7 -->|Coordinator: open Retro| R1
  subgraph Retro
    R1["Coordinator: ask Maintainer to start /retro and present drafts"] -->|Maintainer: start /retro and review drafts| R2{"Maintainer: draft decisions"}
    R2 -->|Maintainer: comment; Coordinator: revise and resubmit| R2
    R2 -->|Maintainer: approve or decline; Coordinator: file exactly or drop| R3{"Coordinator: every draft filed or dropped?"}
    R3 -->|Coordinator: return outstanding drafts| R2
    R3 -->|Coordinator: confirm draft obligations| R4["Coordinator: confirm all obligations and close Retro; lifecycle complete"]
  end
  R4 -->|Coordinator: publish final checkpoint after completion| C1["Coordinator: post complete checkpoint; verify contents and retain URL"]
  C1 -->|Coordinator: check publication and content| C2{"Coordinator: upload and verification successful?"}
  C2 -->|Coordinator: report failure; withhold archive notice and retry| C1
  C2 -->|Coordinator: report verified success| C3["Maintainer: archive worktree"]
